  "duration": 40.717,
  "lines": [
    {
      "key": "hook",
      "text": "Five reasons the fake bag beats the real one. Stay for number one.",
      "start": 0.35,
      "end": 4.149
    },
    {
      "key": "r5",
      "text": "Number five: the price. Three thousand dollars, or about a hundred. Same look, thirty times cheaper.",
      "start": 4.749,
      "end": 10.482
    },
    {
      "key": "r4",
      "text": "Number four: you'll actually use it. No babying it, no dust bag, no panic when it rains.",
      "start": 11.082,
      "end": 16.188
    },
    {
      "key": "r3",
      "text": "Number three: nobody can tell. From across the room, a good replica looks just like the real thing.",
      "start": 16.788,
      "end": 22.271
    },
    {
      "key": "r2",
      "text": "Number two: trends move fast. When the hype dies, you've lost a hundred dollars, not three thousand.",
      "start": 22.871,
      "end": 28.502
    },
    {
      "key": "r1",
      "text": "And number one: the money you keep. Invest the difference, and in ten years it could grow to over five thousand dollars.",
      "start": 29.102,
      "end": 35.653
    },
    {
      "key": "end",
      "text": "So, real or fake? Tell me in the comments.",
      "start": 36.253,
      "end": 38.717
    }
  ],
